   E'FDA label (8.1): there is a pregnancy exposure registry (NAAED) that monitors outcomes in women exposed to antiepileptics; the class increases the risk of congenital malformations.',
   E'Usar com precaução na gravidez; encorajar a inscrição no registo e avaliar alternativas.',
