   E'FDA label (DOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION): in severe renal impairment, the recommended dose is 300 mg every 12 hours; the frequency may be increased to every 8 hours with caution; in severe renal failure accumulation may occur and the lowest frequency compatible with an adequate response should be used.',
   E'Reduzir a dose na insuficiência renal grave; hemodiálise remove o fármaco — ajustar o horário para o fim da diálise.',
